{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"今日は点字ブロックの日。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"岡山県で初めて点字ブロックが\n敷説された日なんだって！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"どんな人にも優しい\nユニバーサルデザインの町に\n世界全体がなればいいな。\nそしたら住みやすいのにね！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今日はのぎ天2にて\n絢音の理想の休日についての回でしたが\n見てくれた方いますか〜？☺︎"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"神楽坂に行ってきました！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"実はそこで花道をさせてもらったんだけど\nこの作品は誰の作品でしょうか！？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/chiharu.saito/img/blog/chiharu.saito/img/2017/03/18/4835098/0000.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"①川後\n②ザキ\n③絢音\n④私\n⑤真洋"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"さあ、皆さん当ててみてください♬"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"見てくれた人はすぐピンとくるはず☺︎"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/chiharu.saito/img/blog/chiharu.saito/img/2017/03/18/4835098/0001.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ちらり。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"みんなひょっこりしてて可愛い☺︎"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/chiharu.saito/img/blog/chiharu.saito/img/2017/03/18/4835098/0002.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"紀の善のあんみつ。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"他の星からのMVのロケ地で有名なお店！\nここにも言って来ちゃいました〜◎"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"皆さんも是非行ってみるべきヽ(；；)丿\n美味しすぎた！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"こんな感じでのぎ天2で\n沢山写真を撮っていましたので\nそこもチェックしてみてください(﹡ˆ ˆ﹡)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今後もちょくちょく載せるかなっ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"------------------------------------------------♡"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"♬ ChihaMusic"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「みんなのうた」SHISHAMOさん"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"共感出来る部分が沢山ある。\nたとえ辛い事があっても\n苦しい出来事に見舞われても\n明日に向かって頑張ろうって\n自分に言い聞かせることは大切だよね。\n\"ごねてる暇はないな\n今日も鏡に向かって笑う\n大丈夫ってつぶやく\"\n言葉に出すと全然心持ちが違う気がする。\n頑張ろう。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/chiharu.saito/img/blog/chiharu.saito/img/2017/03/18/4835098/0003.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"おやすみ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"斎藤ちはる"}],"source":"archive"}